OL,3,GNEWSAPolice accept Andrew search
OL,4,Awarrants were unlawful, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police has accepted that
OL,7,Fthe search warrants it used to search
OL,8,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor's homes
OL,9,Fearlier this year were unlawful, the
OL,10,FHigh Court has heard.
OL,12,FThe force accepted that the information
OL,13,Fgiven to the Old Bailey about warrants
OL,14,Frelating to their decision to search
OL,15,Fthe former Prince Andrew's Sandringham
OL,16,Fhome and the Royal Lodge in Windsor was
OL,17,Fincorrect.
OL,19,FAndrew was arrested by Thames Valley
OL,20,FPolice in February on suspicion of
OL,21,Fmisconduct in public office. He denies
OL,22,Fany wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
